        <object label="&lt;font color=&quot;#3333CC&quot;&gt;Найти&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#009900&quot;&gt;BEGIN&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#CC0066&quot;&gt;конструкта&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font color=&quot;#B38F00&quot;&gt;C&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B38F00&quot;&gt;A&lt;/font&gt;" tpgKind="FindActionNode" tpgVar="A: ConcreteAction" tpgExpr="find ConcreteAction c { $c-&gt;derivedFrom.role == &quot;BEGIN&quot; and $c-&gt;belongsTo == C }" tpgSource="domain/findCorrect.tpg :: tpg CtrlFlow_findCorrect" id="n_find_A">
